            "value" : "Solo simbolo mostra gli importi con il solo simbolo di valuta: $ invece di NZ$."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alleen symbool toont bedragen met alleen het valutasymbool — $ in plaats van NZ$."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Somente símbolo mostra os valores apenas com o símbolo da moeda — $ em vez de NZ$."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Symbol Only shows amounts with just the currency symbol — $ instead of NZ$. Conventional Amount Entry types amounts whole — 324 for 324.00 — instead of filling cents first. Hide Balances masks amounts across the app. Start Page takes effect the next time the app opens." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Symbol Only zeigt nur das Währungssymbol. Conventional Amount Entry gibt ganze Beträge ein. Hide Balances blendet Beträge aus. Start Page gilt beim nächsten Start."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Symbol Only shows amounts with just the currency symbol — $ instead of NZ$. Conventional Amount Entry types amounts whole — 324 for 324.00 — instead of filling cents first. Hide Balances masks amounts across the app. Start Page takes effect the next time the app opens."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Symbol Only muestra solo el símbolo monetario. Conventional Amount Entry introduce importes enteros. Hide Balances oculta los importes. Start Page se aplica al próximo inicio."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Symbol Only affiche uniquement le symbole monétaire. Conventional Amount Entry saisit les montants entiers. Hide Balances masque les montants. Start Page prend effet au prochain lancement."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Symbol Only mostra solo il simbolo della valuta. Conventional Amount Entry inserisce importi interi. Hide Balances nasconde gli importi. Start Page si applica al prossimo avvio."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Symbol Only toont alleen het valutasymbool. Conventional Amount Entry voert hele bedragen in. Hide Balances verbergt bedragen. Start Page wordt toegepast bij de volgende start."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Symbol Only mostra apenas o símbolo da moeda. Conventional Amount Entry digita valores inteiros. Hide Balances oculta os valores. Start Page será aplicado na próxima abertura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
